{
    "title": "Old Navy: Fashion at a Value!",
    "description": "Experience instant \u2018appiness\u2019 with the new and improved Old Navy app! Discover all the feel-good fashion & fantastic deals you\u2019ve come to expect. Mens clothes, womens fashion, kids clothing, accessories and more, available 24/7. It's the ultimate shopping experience, right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nExplore the #musthave app for shoppers on-the-go. Shop everything from maternity clothes and kids shoes to teen clothes and swimwear with Old Navy. Find the best of shopping apps for men, women, and children, with styles that will help you create your perfect outfit. Dresses, shoes, jeans, swimsuits, you name it \u2013 Old Navy has you covered.\r\n\r\nShop for deals conveniently in the online shopping store that brings you all the clothes you\u2019ll need for any day, rain or shine. Is your wardrobe in need of some spring cleaning? Download the Old Navy app now and refresh your closet.\r\n\r\nOLD NAVY FEATURES\r\n\r\nCLOTHES SHOPPING FOR EVERYONE\r\n\r\nExplore our entire assortment of mens style and womens fashion options\r\n\r\nKids fashion or baby clothes. Find covetable new arrivals for the whole family\r\n\r\nBuy clothes on the app made for seamless everyday shopping\r\n\r\n \r\nSHOPPING DEALS FOR YOUR NEXT OUTFIT\r\n\r\nBuy clothes that build your own fashion style with handy search and filter tools & recommendations\r\n\r\nShop clothes, shoes, and accessories and save money every time with deals and discounts\r\n\r\nBuy clothing apparel and shoes affordably when you redeem Super Cash & Rewards with just a tap\r\n\r\n \r\nSHOPPING APP TOOLS\r\n\r\nManage your Gap Inc. Credit Cards easily in-app\r\n\r\nTurn on push notifications to stay in the loop with instant alerts about offers and big sales\r\n\r\nSave your favorite apparel and accessories in a clothes shopping app tailored to you\r\n\r\nConveniently buy online, pickup in-store to get your favorites faster\r\n\r\nClothes shopping is easy when you scan the product barcode in-store to view pics, read reviews & more on the app\r\n\r\nDownload the shiny new online shopping experience and discover the possibilities.\r\n\r\nStay tuned for new features on the way!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience instant \u2018appiness\u2019 with the new and improved Old Navy app! Discover all the feel-good fashion &amp; fantastic deals you\u2019ve come to expect. Mens clothes, womens fashion, kids clothing, accessories and more, available 24/7. It&#39;s the ultimate shopping experience, right at your fingertips.<br><br>Explore the #musthave app for shoppers on-the-go. Shop everything from maternity clothes and kids shoes to teen clothes and swimwear with Old Navy. Find the best of shopping apps for men, women, and children, with styles that will help you create your perfect outfit. Dresses, shoes, jeans, swimsuits, you name it \u2013 Old Navy has you covered.<br><br>Shop for deals conveniently in the online shopping store that brings you all the clothes you\u2019ll need for any day, rain or shine. Is your wardrobe in need of some spring cleaning? Download the Old Navy app now and refresh your closet.<br><br>OLD NAVY FEATURES<br><br>CLOTHES SHOPPING FOR EVERYONE<br><br>Explore our entire assortment of mens style and womens fashion options<br><br>Kids fashion or baby clothes. Find covetable new arrivals for the whole family<br><br>Buy clothes on the app made for seamless everyday shopping<br><br> <br>SHOPPING DEALS FOR YOUR NEXT OUTFIT<br><br>Buy clothes that build your own fashion style with handy search and filter tools &amp; recommendations<br><br>Shop clothes, shoes, and accessories and save money every time with deals and discounts<br><br>Buy clothing apparel and shoes affordably when you redeem Super Cash &amp; Rewards with just a tap<br><br> <br>SHOPPING APP TOOLS<br><br>Manage your Gap Inc. Credit Cards easily in-app<br><br>Turn on push notifications to stay in the loop with instant alerts about offers and big sales<br><br>Save your favorite apparel and accessories in a clothes shopping app tailored to you<br><br>Conveniently buy online, pickup in-store to get your favorites faster<br><br>Clothes shopping is easy when you scan the pr